<div id="2ad64bb4"><article><div class="Page__hero"><div class="Page__heroInner"><h1 class="Page__heading">Kalender</h1></div></div><div class="Page__wrapper"><ol class="jIjgn7qoTMH3b4e0jW3j" id="breadcrumbs"><li><a class="QqohSkg5NSBKEgLCAL46" href="/">Kristiania</a></li><li><a class="QqohSkg5NSBKEgLCAL46" href="/om-kristiania/">Om Kristiania</a></li><li><a class="QqohSkg5NSBKEgLCAL46">Kalender</a></li></ol><ul class="xALaMqIwqVUzIdEGkhJt"><li><div><h2 class="lH1PyHYCFkisiXTWAOnc">6. oktober</h2><ul class="hYFq1l0LwA660pBQwXuO"><li><div class="xGl351nwdVqREX2zGa9O"><div class="VB0_EXNtLRENVEeX_uXV"><a href="/om-kristiania/kalender/call-for-contributions-ark27-ai-as-environment---infrastructure-knowledge-operation/"><div class="slJnKPGAAIKofsQwQBjL zwDimj3fuLgIQIASLUQF"><picture><source sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 1136px, (min-width: 768px) 768px, 100vw" srcSet="/contentassets/6fbddb5cd3cd4599b800176d41b2fd7e/image--esdras-da-costa-the-art-of-the-sublime-2022.jpg?width=375 375w, /contentassets/6fbddb5cd3cd4599b800176d41b2fd7e/image--esdras-da-costa-the-art-of-the-sublime-2022.jpg?width=768 768w, /contentassets/6fbddb5cd3cd4599b800176d41b2fd7e/image--esdras-da-costa-the-art-of-the-sublime-2022.jpg?width=1136 1136w"/><img src="/contentassets/6fbddb5cd3cd4599b800176d41b2fd7e/image--esdras-da-costa-the-art-of-the-sublime-2022.jpg?width=1440" loading="lazy"/></picture></div></a></div><div class="Ut1FsSTe8brtdYBNpK6j"><div class="fSSqO9vcR05NAoeCTy_A"><a href="/om-kristiania/kalender/call-for-contributions-ark27-ai-as-environment---infrastructure-knowledge-operation/"><h3 class="uh4lwjP2i2qkhx9mBeYe">Call for contributions: AI as Environment - Infrastructure, Knowledge, Operation</h3><div class="kKb5XxGFGimboc1zimkq"><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-map-pin"></use></svg></span><span>Høyskolen Kristiania</span></div><div class="ODRWpJpHfUjdPDEwY9gh"><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-clock"></use></svg></span><span>1. November, 2026</span></div></a><hr aria-orientation="horizontal" class="WSxEXxL9Q90jOhNoDDDW"/><div class="AoSvIOK9WlUZQZkB5NJc"><span>The 9th Annual Artistic Research at Kristiania Symposium (AR@K27) &amp; the 2nd MishMash Conference. Co-organised with AI Ecologies Research Group, Kristiania AI Centre (KAI), and Atelier Nord.</span></div></div></div><a href="/om-kristiania/kalender/call-for-contributions-ark27-ai-as-environment---infrastructure-knowledge-operation/"><span class="visuallyHidden">Les mer</span></a></div></li></ul></div></li><li><div><h2 class="lH1PyHYCFkisiXTWAOnc">9. oktober</h2><ul class="hYFq1l0LwA660pBQwXuO"><li><div class="xGl351nwdVqREX2zGa9O"><div class="VB0_EXNtLRENVEeX_uXV"><a href="/om-kristiania/kalender/disputas-janaina-pereira-lazzaretti-bull/"><div class="slJnKPGAAIKofsQwQBjL zwDimj3fuLgIQIASLUQF"><picture><source sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 1136px, (min-width: 768px) 768px, 100vw" srcSet="/contentassets/7cb105d6fe0c4624805861e71118073c/janaina-bull.jpg?width=375 375w, /contentassets/7cb105d6fe0c4624805861e71118073c/janaina-bull.jpg?width=768 768w, /contentassets/7cb105d6fe0c4624805861e71118073c/janaina-bull.jpg?width=1136 1136w"/><img src="/contentassets/7cb105d6fe0c4624805861e71118073c/janaina-bull.jpg?width=1440" alt="Portrettfoto av Janaina Pereira Lazzaretti Bull" loading="lazy"/></picture></div></a></div><div class="Ut1FsSTe8brtdYBNpK6j"><div class="fSSqO9vcR05NAoeCTy_A"><a href="/om-kristiania/kalender/disputas-janaina-pereira-lazzaretti-bull/"><h3 class="uh4lwjP2i2qkhx9mBeYe">Disputas: Jana&iacute;na Pereira Lazzaretti Bull</h3><div class="kKb5XxGFGimboc1zimkq"><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-map-pin"></use></svg></span><span>D502 – Kirkegata 23-25</span></div><div class="ODRWpJpHfUjdPDEwY9gh"><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-clock"></use></svg></span><span>10:00 - 15:30</span></div></a><hr aria-orientation="horizontal" class="WSxEXxL9Q90jOhNoDDDW"/><div class="AoSvIOK9WlUZQZkB5NJc">Jana&iacute;na Pereira Lazzaretti Bull forsvarer avhandlingen sin: "Examining the accessibility of tourism destination websites in Norway " for graden ph.d. i kommunikasjon og ledelse</div></div></div><a href="/om-kristiania/kalender/disputas-janaina-pereira-lazzaretti-bull/"><span class="visuallyHidden">Les mer</span></a></div></li><li><div class="xGl351nwdVqREX2zGa9O"><div class="VB0_EXNtLRENVEeX_uXV"><a href="/om-kristiania/kalender/bibliotekkurs-akademisk-lesing-og-skriving-09.10"><div class="slJnKPGAAIKofsQwQBjL zwDimj3fuLgIQIASLUQF"><picture><source sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 1136px, (min-width: 768px) 768px, 100vw" srcSet="/contentassets/0cddda8d82e24640a9c1ad22619b24a8/_dsc9188.jpg?width=375 375w, /contentassets/0cddda8d82e24640a9c1ad22619b24a8/_dsc9188.jpg?width=768 768w, /contentassets/0cddda8d82e24640a9c1ad22619b24a8/_dsc9188.jpg?width=1136 1136w"/><img src="/contentassets/0cddda8d82e24640a9c1ad22619b24a8/_dsc9188.jpg?width=1440" loading="lazy"/></picture></div></a></div><div class="Ut1FsSTe8brtdYBNpK6j"><div class="fSSqO9vcR05NAoeCTy_A"><a href="/om-kristiania/kalender/bibliotekkurs-akademisk-lesing-og-skriving-09.10"><h3 class="uh4lwjP2i2qkhx9mBeYe">Bibliotekkurs: Akademisk lesing og skriving</h3><div class="kKb5XxGFGimboc1zimkq"><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-map-pin"></use></svg></span><span>Kirkegata 24-26, 4. etasjen. Rom: A410</span></div><div class="ODRWpJpHfUjdPDEwY9gh"><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-clock"></use></svg></span><span>11:15-13:00</span></div></a><hr aria-orientation="horizontal" class="WSxEXxL9Q90jOhNoDDDW"/><div class="AoSvIOK9WlUZQZkB5NJc"><span data-contrast="none"><span>Er det vanskelig &aring; komme i gang med oppgaveskrivingen? Hvor skal du begynne? Hva burde du lese for &aring; komme i</span><span>&nbsp;</span><span>gang?&nbsp;</span></span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="none"><span>Er dette sp&oslash;rsm&aring;l som h&oslash;res kjent ut?&nbsp;Da burde du melde deg p&aring; dette&nbsp;</span><span>kurset om akademisk lesing og skriving!&nbsp;</span></span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}">&nbsp;</span></div></div></div><a href="/om-kristiania/kalender/bibliotekkurs-akademisk-lesing-og-skriving-09.10"><span class="visuallyHidden">Les mer</span></a></div></li></ul></div></li><li><div><h2 class="lH1PyHYCFkisiXTWAOnc">14. oktober</h2><ul class="hYFq1l0LwA660pBQwXuO"><li><div class="xGl351nwdVqREX2zGa9O"><div class="VB0_EXNtLRENVEeX_uXV"><a href="/om-kristiania/kalender/hva-vet-vi-na-om-norsk-utenlandsadopsjon/"><div class="slJnKPGAAIKofsQwQBjL zwDimj3fuLgIQIASLUQF"><picture><source sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 1136px, (min-width: 768px) 768px, 100vw" srcSet="/contentassets/ae9b1a41220749a79a6a3b6283f9f168/adopsjon-frokost_1250_730-1.jpg?width=375 375w, /contentassets/ae9b1a41220749a79a6a3b6283f9f168/adopsjon-frokost_1250_730-1.jpg?width=768 768w, /contentassets/ae9b1a41220749a79a6a3b6283f9f168/adopsjon-frokost_1250_730-1.jpg?width=1136 1136w"/><img src="/contentassets/ae9b1a41220749a79a6a3b6283f9f168/adopsjon-frokost_1250_730-1.jpg?width=1440" alt="Kalenderoppslag for Kristiania-frokost med tittel &quot;Hva vet vi nå om norsk utenlandsadopsjon?&quot;" loading="lazy"/></picture></div></a></div><div class="Ut1FsSTe8brtdYBNpK6j"><div class="fSSqO9vcR05NAoeCTy_A"><a href="/om-kristiania/kalender/hva-vet-vi-na-om-norsk-utenlandsadopsjon/"><h3 class="uh4lwjP2i2qkhx9mBeYe">Hva vet vi n&aring; om norsk utenlandsadopsjon?</h3><div class="kKb5XxGFGimboc1zimkq"><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-map-pin"></use></svg></span><span>Kirkegata 24, Ernst hage</span></div></a><hr aria-orientation="horizontal" class="WSxEXxL9Q90jOhNoDDDW"/><div class="AoSvIOK9WlUZQZkB5NJc"><span data-contrast="none"><span>Granskingen av norsk utenlandsadopsjon har gitt oss ny kunnskap om et system som har eksistert gjennom flere ti&aring;r. Hva betyr funnene &ndash; og hvilke sp&oslash;rsm&aring;l st&aring;r fortsatt ubesvart?&nbsp;</span></span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}">&nbsp;</span></div></div></div><a href="/om-kristiania/kalender/hva-vet-vi-na-om-norsk-utenlandsadopsjon/"><span class="visuallyHidden">Les mer</span></a></div></li><li><div class="xGl351nwdVqREX2zGa9O"><div class="VB0_EXNtLRENVEeX_uXV"><a href="/om-kristiania/kalender/bibliotekkurs-zotero-og-kildehenvisning-14.11"><div class="slJnKPGAAIKofsQwQBjL zwDimj3fuLgIQIASLUQF"><picture><source sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 1136px, (min-width: 768px) 768px, 100vw" srcSet="/globalassets/bilder-av-lokaler/fjerdingen/campusfjerdingen_kristiania-11.jpg?width=375 375w, /globalassets/bilder-av-lokaler/fjerdingen/campusfjerdingen_kristiania-11.jpg?width=768 768w, /globalassets/bilder-av-lokaler/fjerdingen/campusfjerdingen_kristiania-11.jpg?width=1136 1136w"/><img src="/globalassets/bilder-av-lokaler/fjerdingen/campusfjerdingen_kristiania-11.jpg?width=1440" alt="Visning av bøker på Fjerdingen bibliotek" loading="lazy"/></picture></div></a></div><div class="Ut1FsSTe8brtdYBNpK6j"><div class="fSSqO9vcR05NAoeCTy_A"><a href="/om-kristiania/kalender/bibliotekkurs-zotero-og-kildehenvisning-14.11"><h3 class="uh4lwjP2i2qkhx9mBeYe"><span>Bibliotekkurs: Zotero og kildehenvisning</span></h3><div class="kKb5XxGFGimboc1zimkq"><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-map-pin"></use></svg></span><span>Kirkegata 24-26, 4. etasjen. Rom: A410</span></div><div class="ODRWpJpHfUjdPDEwY9gh"><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-clock"></use></svg></span><span>10:15-12:00</span></div></a><hr aria-orientation="horizontal" class="WSxEXxL9Q90jOhNoDDDW"/><div class="AoSvIOK9WlUZQZkB5NJc"><strong><span data-contrast="auto">Usikker&nbsp;p&aring;&nbsp;referering?&nbsp;Trenger&nbsp;du &aring;&nbsp;f&aring;&nbsp;orden&nbsp;p&aring;&nbsp;referansene&nbsp;dine?&nbsp;</span></strong><strong><span data-contrast="auto">Kom igang med Zotero fra f&oslash;rste stund s&aring; du slipper stresset!</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}">&nbsp;</span></strong></div></div></div><a href="/om-kristiania/kalender/bibliotekkurs-zotero-og-kildehenvisning-14.11"><span class="visuallyHidden">Les mer</span></a></div></li><li><div class="xGl351nwdVqREX2zGa9O"><div class="VB0_EXNtLRENVEeX_uXV"><a href="/om-kristiania/kalender/kai-evening-artificial-intelligence-as-an-epistemic-toy/"><div class="slJnKPGAAIKofsQwQBjL zwDimj3fuLgIQIASLUQF"><picture><source sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 1136px, (min-width: 768px) 768px, 100vw" srcSet="/contentassets/27608d06d66e479e84b19595b7cfaeea/eventkalender-1250x730-mal-2_1250_730-3.jpg?width=375 375w, /contentassets/27608d06d66e479e84b19595b7cfaeea/eventkalender-1250x730-mal-2_1250_730-3.jpg?width=768 768w, /contentassets/27608d06d66e479e84b19595b7cfaeea/eventkalender-1250x730-mal-2_1250_730-3.jpg?width=1136 1136w"/><img src="/contentassets/27608d06d66e479e84b19595b7cfaeea/eventkalender-1250x730-mal-2_1250_730-3.jpg?width=1440" alt="Foredragsholder Wolfgang Ernst holder et papir i et rotete ro,. samt tittelen på eventet. " style="object-position:70% 15%" loading="lazy"/></picture></div></a></div><div class="Ut1FsSTe8brtdYBNpK6j"><div class="fSSqO9vcR05NAoeCTy_A"><a href="/om-kristiania/kalender/kai-evening-artificial-intelligence-as-an-epistemic-toy/"><h3 class="uh4lwjP2i2qkhx9mBeYe">kAI-evening: &ldquo;Artificial Intelligence as an Epistemic Toy&rdquo;&nbsp;</h3><div class="kKb5XxGFGimboc1zimkq"><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-map-pin"></use></svg></span><span>Kirkegata 24</span></div><div class="ODRWpJpHfUjdPDEwY9gh"><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-clock"></use></svg></span><span>17:00-19:30</span></div></a><hr aria-orientation="horizontal" class="WSxEXxL9Q90jOhNoDDDW"/><div class="AoSvIOK9WlUZQZkB5NJc">Hvordan &laquo;tenker&raquo; kunstig intelligens, og hva kan teknologien fortelle oss om menneskelig kunnskap, tenkning og intelligens? Hva skjer egentlig inne i KI, og hva betyr det &aring; v&aelig;re intelligent?&nbsp;</div></div></div><a href="/om-kristiania/kalender/kai-evening-artificial-intelligence-as-an-epistemic-toy/"><span class="visuallyHidden">Les mer</span></a></div></li><li><div class="xGl351nwdVqREX2zGa9O"><div class="VB0_EXNtLRENVEeX_uXV"><a href="/om-kristiania/kalender/writing-the-writer/"><div class="slJnKPGAAIKofsQwQBjL zwDimj3fuLgIQIASLUQF"><picture><source sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 1136px, (min-width: 768px) 768px, 100vw" srcSet="/contentassets/3d0c97a3ac51459981abdf31b46f6464/800935246_10164577784323847_6368590215839714365_n-kopi.jpg?width=375 375w, /contentassets/3d0c97a3ac51459981abdf31b46f6464/800935246_10164577784323847_6368590215839714365_n-kopi.jpg?width=768 768w, /contentassets/3d0c97a3ac51459981abdf31b46f6464/800935246_10164577784323847_6368590215839714365_n-kopi.jpg?width=1136 1136w"/><img src="/contentassets/3d0c97a3ac51459981abdf31b46f6464/800935246_10164577784323847_6368590215839714365_n-kopi.jpg?width=1440" loading="lazy"/></picture></div></a></div><div class="Ut1FsSTe8brtdYBNpK6j"><div class="fSSqO9vcR05NAoeCTy_A"><a href="/om-kristiania/kalender/writing-the-writer/"><h3 class="uh4lwjP2i2qkhx9mBeYe">Boklansering: Writing the writer - the making of a biographical screenplay</h3><div class="kKb5XxGFGimboc1zimkq"><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-map-pin"></use></svg></span><span>Vega scene</span></div><div class="ODRWpJpHfUjdPDEwY9gh"><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-clock"></use></svg></span><span>17:30 - 20:30</span></div></a><hr aria-orientation="horizontal" class="WSxEXxL9Q90jOhNoDDDW"/><div class="AoSvIOK9WlUZQZkB5NJc">Boken inneholder Siri Senjes dramatekst om Henrik og Suzannah Ibsens turbulente ungdoms&aring;r, beriket med tekst og bilder fra skriveprosessen og Fredrik Eive Refslis unike bokdesign. Bli med inn i den kreative prosessen bak et filmmanus i sjangeren biografisk fiksjon.&nbsp;</div></div></div><a href="/om-kristiania/kalender/writing-the-writer/"><span class="visuallyHidden">Les mer</span></a></div></li></ul></div></li><li><div><h2 class="lH1PyHYCFkisiXTWAOnc">3. november</h2><ul class="hYFq1l0LwA660pBQwXuO"><li><div class="xGl351nwdVqREX2zGa9O"><div class="VB0_EXNtLRENVEeX_uXV"><a href="/om-kristiania/kalender/bibliotekkurs-akademisk-lesing-og-skriving-03.11"><div class="slJnKPGAAIKofsQwQBjL zwDimj3fuLgIQIASLUQF"><picture><source sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 1136px, (min-width: 768px) 768px, 100vw" srcSet="/globalassets/sample-pictures/_dsc9188.jpg?width=375 375w, /globalassets/sample-pictures/_dsc9188.jpg?width=768 768w, /globalassets/sample-pictures/_dsc9188.jpg?width=1136 1136w"/><img src="/globalassets/sample-pictures/_dsc9188.jpg?width=1440" loading="lazy"/></picture></div></a></div><div class="Ut1FsSTe8brtdYBNpK6j"><div class="fSSqO9vcR05NAoeCTy_A"><a href="/om-kristiania/kalender/bibliotekkurs-akademisk-lesing-og-skriving-03.11"><h3 class="uh4lwjP2i2qkhx9mBeYe">Bibliotekkurs: Akademisk lesing og skriving</h3><div class="kKb5XxGFGimboc1zimkq"><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-map-pin"></use></svg></span><span>Kirkegata 24-26, 4. etasjen. Rom: A410</span></div><div class="ODRWpJpHfUjdPDEwY9gh"><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-clock"></use></svg></span><span>13:15-15:00</span></div></a><hr aria-orientation="horizontal" class="WSxEXxL9Q90jOhNoDDDW"/><div class="AoSvIOK9WlUZQZkB5NJc"><span data-contrast="none"><span>Er det vanskelig &aring; komme i gang med oppgaveskrivingen? Hvor skal du begynne? Hva burde du lese for &aring; komme i</span><span>&nbsp;</span><span>gang?&nbsp;</span></span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="none"><span>Er dette sp&oslash;rsm&aring;l som h&oslash;res kjent ut?&nbsp;Da burde du melde deg p&aring; dette </span><span>kurset om akademisk lesing og skriving!&nbsp;</span></span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}">&nbsp;</span></div></div></div><a href="/om-kristiania/kalender/bibliotekkurs-akademisk-lesing-og-skriving-03.11"><span class="visuallyHidden">Les mer</span></a></div></li></ul></div></li><li><div><h2 class="lH1PyHYCFkisiXTWAOnc">12. november</h2><ul class="hYFq1l0LwA660pBQwXuO"><li><div class="xGl351nwdVqREX2zGa9O"><div class="VB0_EXNtLRENVEeX_uXV"><a href="/om-kristiania/kalender/bibliotekkurs-zotero-og-kildehenvisning-12.11"><div class="slJnKPGAAIKofsQwQBjL zwDimj3fuLgIQIASLUQF"><picture><source sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 1136px, (min-width: 768px) 768px, 100vw" srcSet="/globalassets/bilder-av-lokaler/fjerdingen/campusfjerdingen_kristiania-11.jpg?width=375 375w, /globalassets/bilder-av-lokaler/fjerdingen/campusfjerdingen_kristiania-11.jpg?width=768 768w, /globalassets/bilder-av-lokaler/fjerdingen/campusfjerdingen_kristiania-11.jpg?width=1136 1136w"/><img src="/globalassets/bilder-av-lokaler/fjerdingen/campusfjerdingen_kristiania-11.jpg?width=1440" alt="Visning av bøker på Fjerdingen bibliotek" loading="lazy"/></picture></div></a></div><div class="Ut1FsSTe8brtdYBNpK6j"><div class="fSSqO9vcR05NAoeCTy_A"><a href="/om-kristiania/kalender/bibliotekkurs-zotero-og-kildehenvisning-12.11"><h3 class="uh4lwjP2i2qkhx9mBeYe"><span>Bibliotekkurs: Zotero og kildehenvisning</span></h3><div class="kKb5XxGFGimboc1zimkq"><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-map-pin"></use></svg></span><span>Kirkegata 24-26, 4. etasjen. Rom: A410</span></div><div class="ODRWpJpHfUjdPDEwY9gh"><span clas