mkq"><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-map-pin"></use></svg></span><span>Kirkegata 24-26, 4. etasjen. Rom: A410</span></div><div class="ODRWpJpHfUjdPDEwY9gh"><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-clock"></use></svg></span><span>08:15 - 10:00</span></div></a><hr aria-orientation="horizontal" class="WSxEXxL9Q90jOhNoDDDW"/><div class="AoSvIOK9WlUZQZkB5NJc">Hva er lov? Hva er ikke lov? Hvordan bruker jeg KI p&aring; en trygg m&aring;te? Er dette sp&oslash;rsm&aring;l du sp&oslash;r deg selv n&aring;r du skriver oppgaver med hjelp av KI?&nbsp;</p>
<p><span data-contrast="none"><span>Da </span><span>burde</span><span>&nbsp;du&nbsp;</span><span>melde</span><span>&nbsp;</span><span>deg</span><span>&nbsp;</span><span>p&aring;</span><span>&nbsp;</span><span>bibliotekets</span><span>&nbsp;</span><span>kurs</span><span>&nbsp;om KI i oppgaveskriving!</span></span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}">&nbsp;</span></div></div></div><a href="/om-kristiania/kalender/bibliotekkurs-ki-i-oppgaveskriving-17.11"><span class="visuallyHidden">Les mer</span></a></div></li></ul></div></li><li><div><h2 class="lH1PyHYCFkisiXTWAOnc">26. november</h2><ul class="hYFq1l0LwA660pBQwXuO"><li><div class="xGl351nwdVqREX2zGa9O"><div class="VB0_EXNtLRENVEeX_uXV"><a href="/om-kristiania/kalender/bibliotekkurs-litteratursok-for-teoretiske-oppgaver-26.11"><div class="slJnKPGAAIKofsQwQBjL zwDimj3fuLgIQIASLUQF"><picture><source sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 1136px, (min-width: 768px) 768px, 100vw" srcSet="/globalassets/sample-pictures/shutterstock_1068141515.jpg?width=375 375w, /globalassets/sample-pictures/shutterstock_1068141515.jpg?width=768 768w, /globalassets/sample-pictures/shutterstock_1068141515.jpg?width=1136 1136w"/><img src="/globalassets/sample-pictures/shutterstock_1068141515.jpg?width=1440" loading="lazy"/></picture></div></a></div><div class="Ut1FsSTe8brtdYBNpK6j"><div class="fSSqO9vcR05NAoeCTy_A"><a href="/om-kristiania/kalender/bibliotekkurs-litteratursok-for-teoretiske-oppgaver-26.11"><h3 class="uh4lwjP2i2qkhx9mBeYe">Bibliotekkurs: Litteraturs&oslash;k for teoretiske oppgaver/litteraturstudier</h3><div class="kKb5XxGFGimboc1zimkq"><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-map-pin"></use></svg></span><span>Kirkegata 24-26, 4. etasjen. Rom: A410</span></div><div class="ODRWpJpHfUjdP